Hi {Owner},

I build websites for independent gyms and CrossFit boxes around {City}. {Business Name} has a strong community on its social pages, but no site that explains the on-ramp and books a free class.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: the class timetable, a foundations course page, a daily workout board, a drop-in page and a free class booking, with marked placeholders where your photos would go. It hands bookings to the gym software you already use:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and timetable changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes in the midday gap between classes?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
